Z||000014||AusFiero||10-18-2001||11:11 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Ken Wittlief:<BR><B> maybe we should get a jump on things - get rid of pennys from circulation<P> and nickels too</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Australia used to have currency as follows. <BR>1c 2c 5c and 50c coins.<BR>$1 $2 $5, $10, $20 and $50 bills.<P>As inflation rose and the currency dropped we now have.<BR>5c, 10c, 20, 50c, $1 and $2 coins.<BR>$5, $10, $20, $50 and $100 bills.<P>Proving 1c or 2c buys nothing anymore.<BR>As kids we could buy 20c worth of mixed lollies and get 20 to 40 lollies. Now we can buy 2 to 4 small lollies for the same.<BR>Lollies are candy by the way for the non AUstralian speaking people  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero2.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
