Z||000028||Ken Wittlief||10-19-2001||08:30 AM||||Interesting note on the federal reserve bank. It was first proposed in Lincolns term of office - he stopped it. He was assassinated.<P> It think it was McKinely who opposed it next - he was assassinated too.<P> Wilson allowed it to happen.<P> Kennedy was against it and he had put things in motion to END IT. He already had new money being printed that would NOT be federal reserve notes.<P> He was assassinated. His successor, Johnson, reversed JFK plans and allowed the federal reserve to remain in charge of our currency.||||reg||11
